f your VR and real life workouts in one place. Get even more detailed wellness insights from YUR's dashboard. Compete against your friends and the YUR community in head-to-head fitness battles and monthly fitness challenges. There\u2019s nothing wrong with a little competition to fuel the fire. \n\nThink you have good reflexes? Work up a sweat and keep your mind sharp with Reaction. Only hit the targets that light up in front of you. In Swap, cool down and concentrate on connecting objects in a row. Barriers will fly towards you to keep you on your toes. In Oddity, wield weapons to destroy the walls around you.\n\nJoin our community at yur.chat! Check out https://yur.wiki/ for quick support or email support@yur.energy", "short_description": "Make Fitness A Game\u2122"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://yur.energy/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.yur.energy/terms", "publisher_name": "YUR", "support_website_url": "https://yur.chat/", "website_url": "https://yur.world/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3300475730279306"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1214180122531985"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1214180122531985"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1674756000, "status": "PUBLI